schway-screen 1
screen help-palette-guidance
title Help keyboard guidance
description Enter on a keyboard action shows its exact keys and prerequisites without performing it.
variant light-50
size 50x30
cursor 10 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project


 scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key












  Copy code or a result · Alt+I, then C
  Inspect a block before copying it
  Return to the conversation and press Alt+I.
  Use ↑↓ to select a code block, table or tool
  result, then C to copy the highlighted block.
  Enter copies code and tables; it does not copy
  tool results. R opens a code block or table in
  the reader.
  ! Nothing to inspect · Enter send a task
